    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25973" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lătĕrĭtāna</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lătĕrĭtĭāna</span></b> ,
			ōrum, n. (pira), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a good sort of
			pears</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 5, 10, 18</span></i>; <i><span class="en">12, 10, 4</span></i>; also,
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lătĕrĭāna</span></b> ,
