				15, 15, 16, § 54</span></i>; and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lătĕrīsĭāna</span></b> ,
					<i><span class="en">Macr. S. 2, 15</span></i>. (Perhaps pears
			from Laterium, in Arpinum; v. Laterium).</div>
